wordcraft-doc
=============

This package is a Node.js binding for WordCraft, a Rust implementation of the
Word 97-2003 binary format (.doc, [MS-DOC]) reader and the DOCX (OOXML
WordprocessingML) writer.

Upstream project: https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft
Upstream version: see UPSTREAM.md
Upstream license: MIT OR Apache-2.0
Upstream copyright: 2026 ArtCraft Team and the WordCraft contributors

The upstream source is used unmodified, as a git submodule at
upstream/wordcraft. Only the binding layer (native/), the npm packaging
(npm/, scripts/) and the tests are original to this project.

The published npm main package and each platform package include a generated
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md report with the license texts for the resolved native
Rust dependency graph. It is generated from native/Cargo.lock with cargo-about.
The report supplements, and does not replace, each crate's applicable notices.
